'' std/numeric (RFC-0009): Complex into an FB.Complex parameter; CAbs, Clamp, GCD; vector.bi's macro-made Vec2f and its public factory Vec2f_; a const; NaN.
'' It is a facade -- exported macros over the header, found through -i as a user's toolchain
'' finds it in its inc/ -- and the program includes that header too, so the facade's names
'' and the header's FB names are shown to be one and the same.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc -i toolchains/tiko-windows/inc tests/modules/src/stdfacade/numeric.bas -o tests/modules/stdnumeric.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/modules/stdnumeric.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 5 5 106
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 5 -1 true
